{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/008-shop-upgrade-part-2/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Wood Times"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"4cb38f95-7bea-5707-b068-5fa057df7909","excerpt":"With the basic infrastructure in place, it was time for some finishing touches that would make the shop not just functional, but enjoyable to work in. A feature…","html":"<p>With the basic infrastructure in place, it was time for some finishing touches that would make the shop not just functional, but enjoyable to work in. A feature wall, better lighting, and some custom tool storage were on the agenda.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/28da39a1a8c992c6a13c0b1ce3a60aad/493ac/shiplap_wall.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Shiplap Wall\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/28da39a1a8c992c6a13c0b1ce3a60aad/f058b/shiplap_wall.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/28da39a1a8c992c6a13c0b1ce3a60aad/c26ae/shiplap_wall.png 158w,\n/static/28da39a1a8c992c6a13c0b1ce3a60aad/6bdcf/shiplap_wall.png 315w,\n/static/28da39a1a8c992c6a13c0b1ce3a60aad/f058b/shiplap_wall.png 630w,\n/static/28da39a1a8c992c6a13c0b1ce3a60aad/40601/shiplap_wall.png 945w,\n/static/28da39a1a8c992c6a13c0b1ce3a60aad/78612/shiplap_wall.png 1260w,\n/static/28da39a1a8c992c6a13c0b1ce3a60aad/493ac/shiplap_wall.png 4032w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The centerpiece of this upgrade was a french cleat tool wall. Beyond looking great, the horizontal boards created natural ledges for mounting tool holders and shelves. Speakers flanked the wall for essential shop tunes, and a new shelf held the  receiver. LED strip lighting along the ceiling provided even, shadow-free illumination.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/2bcd179dda8ec727e0828ba2ef06e233/493ac/chisel_holder.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Chisel Holder\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/2bcd179dda8ec727e0828ba2ef06e233/f058b/chisel_holder.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/2bcd179dda8ec727e0828ba2ef06e233/c26ae/chisel_holder.png 158w,\n/static/2bcd179dda8ec727e0828ba2ef06e233/6bdcf/chisel_holder.png 315w,\n/static/2bcd179dda8ec727e0828ba2ef06e233/f058b/chisel_holder.png 630w,\n/static/2bcd179dda8ec727e0828ba2ef06e233/40601/chisel_holder.png 945w,\n/static/2bcd179dda8ec727e0828ba2ef06e233/78612/chisel_holder.png 1260w,\n/static/2bcd179dda8ec727e0828ba2ef06e233/493ac/chisel_holder.png 4032w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>Custom tool holders made from scrap plywood took advantage of the new cleat wall. Chisels, screwdrivers, and other hand tools were now visible and within easy reach. No more digging through drawers.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/98da59f788cb9d903a3bf49040602865/493ac/drill_bit_holder.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Drill Bit Holder\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/98da59f788cb9d903a3bf49040602865/f058b/drill_bit_holder.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/98da59f788cb9d903a3bf49040602865/c26ae/drill_bit_holder.png 158w,\n/static/98da59f788cb9d903a3bf49040602865/6bdcf/drill_bit_holder.png 315w,\n/static/98da59f788cb9d903a3bf49040602865/f058b/drill_bit_holder.png 630w,\n/static/98da59f788cb9d903a3bf49040602865/40601/drill_bit_holder.png 945w,\n/static/98da59f788cb9d903a3bf49040602865/78612/drill_bit_holder.png 1260w,\n/static/98da59f788cb9d903a3bf49040602865/493ac/drill_bit_holder.png 4032w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>A dedicated drill bit holder with sizes burned into the wood meant no more guessing or hunting for the right bit. Small touches like this add up to significant time savings over the course of a project.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/1f4813d7dc66fd0765d3343fe1b25d61/493ac/full_shop.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Full Shop\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/1f4813d7dc66fd0765d3343fe1b25d61/f058b/full_shop.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/1f4813d7dc66fd0765d3343fe1b25d61/c26ae/full_shop.png 158w,\n/static/1f4813d7dc66fd0765d3343fe1b25d61/6bdcf/full_shop.png 315w,\n/static/1f4813d7dc66fd0765d3343fe1b25d61/f058b/full_shop.png 630w,\n/static/1f4813d7dc66fd0765d3343fe1b25d61/40601/full_shop.png 945w,\n/static/1f4813d7dc66fd0765d3343fe1b25d61/78612/full_shop.png 1260w,\n/static/1f4813d7dc66fd0765d3343fe1b25d61/493ac/full_shop.png 4032w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>Standing back, the shop had transformed from a raw garage into a proper workspace. The drill press, bandsaw, and other tools were arranged for efficient workflow, with the tool wall and bench at the core.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/a39645b9311cdce83ae124918eef5bb6/493ac/led_lighting.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"LED Lighting\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/a39645b9311cdce83ae124918eef5bb6/f058b/led_lighting.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/a39645b9311cdce83ae124918eef5bb6/c26ae/led_lighting.png 158w,\n/static/a39645b9311cdce83ae124918eef5bb6/6bdcf/led_lighting.png 315w,\n/static/a39645b9311cdce83ae124918eef5bb6/f058b/led_lighting.png 630w,\n/static/a39645b9311cdce83ae124918eef5bb6/40601/led_lighting.png 945w,\n/static/a39645b9311cdce83ae124918eef5bb6/78612/led_lighting.png 1260w,\n/static/a39645b9311cdce83ae124918eef5bb6/493ac/led_lighting.png 4032w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The LED lighting deserved its own moment. Strips along the ceiling provided ambient light, while under-cabinet strips illuminated work surfaces. The color-changing capability was admittedly more fun than functional, but why not enjoy where you spend your time?</p>\n<p>A shop should inspire you to make things. These upgrades turned a utilitarian space into somewhere I actually wanted to be.</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"Shop Upgrade Part 2 - Shiplap and Lighting","date":"March 25, 2018","description":null}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/007-shop-upgrade-part-1/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Shop Upgrade Part 1 - Walls and Storage"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/009-paper-towel-holder/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Paper Towel Holder"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"4cb38f95-7bea-5707-b068-5fa057df7909","previousPostId":"d68babea-8b7d-5e96-adf0-0b79efda4a4f","nextPostId":"2b9c7766-6857-585f-a6a0-0497d1962e87"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2841359383"],"slicesMap":{}}